---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import Image from '../assets/mex.png';
---

<Layout
  title="About Me"
  description="Learn more about Helmar Baechle: Amazon L3 Support Associate, technologist, and global traveler from the Black Forest."
  pubDate={new Date('February 18 2026')}
>
  <img src={Image.src} alt="Helmar Baechle" class="rounded-full w-48 h-48 mx-auto shadow-lg" />
  
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-justify py-3.5 px-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-4">Helmar Baechle</h2>
    
    <p class="mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
      Born in the heart of the **Black Forest**, I carry the region's tradition of precision and craftsmanship into everything I build. My journey has been shaped by a global outlook, including **living and working in the UK for six years**. This period was instrumental in my growth, providing me with a wealth of international experience and a high-level professional foundation that I bring to every project today.
    </p>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-800">Professional Expertise</h3>
    <p class="mb-6 text-gray-600">
      Currently, I serve as a **Level 3 Support Associate at Amazon**, where I expertly manage complex, high-priority escalations for premium sellers. My role requires deep analytical problem-solving and the ability to navigate intricate technical ecosystems under pressure—skills further honed during my extensive time in the British corporate landscape.
    </p>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-800">Technical Stack & Innovation</h3>
    <p class="mb-2 text-gray-600">
      I am an avid technologist constantly exploring the edge of web development and automation. My current core stack includes:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-6 text-gray-600 space-y-1">
      <li><strong>Cloud & DevOps:</strong> Google Cloud Platform (GCP), Docker, Firebase</li>
      <li><strong>AI & Automation:</strong> AI Stack integration, n8n workflows</li>
      <li><strong>Modern Web:</strong> Next.js, React, and a growing passion for Astro.js</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-800">The Creator & Traveler</h3>
    <p class="mb-4 text-gray-600">
      Beyond code, I am a Creator and Producer. I handle everything that comes with video, photography, and web development, merging aesthetics with function.
    </p>
    <p class="text-gray-600">
      I bring a truly global perspective to my work, having traveled to **76 countries**. This experience has shaped my adaptability and curiosity, driving me to consistently seek new challenges—both professionally and personally.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>